return {
    ["\"头狼\"鲁珀-1星"] = "\"Alpha Wolf\" Lupo - 1 Star",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默片刻）</>我每隔一段时间就会陷入沉睡，醒来之后会失忆，然后开启下一段人生。就这样不断地沉睡，醒来，失去，寻找……"] = "<P_Heart>(Silence for a moment)</> I fall into a deep sleep every so often. After waking up, I lose my memories and then start the next life. Just like that, constantly sleeping, waking up, losing, and searching...",
    ["<Yellow>奥尔米尔的冠冕</>：将佩戴者的解控技能置换成更强大的<Yellow>荣耀之证</>：\n解除自身控制，进入4秒的<Yellow>光芒牢笼</>状态，期间获得<Yellow>霸体</>和<Yellow>50%</>减伤，将每次受到伤害里不超过生命值上限10%的部分，按<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}</>倍反弹给攻击者（对8米外的目标，反弹伤害额外衰减，最多衰减至8米内的20%）。<Yellow>光芒牢笼</>结束时，对周身8米内的最多6名敌对目标造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并对其施加持续<Yellow>10</>秒的<Yellow>眩目</>效果，使其攻击降低<Yellow>*d</>。\n技能冷却时间：30秒。"] = "<Yellow>Almir's Crown</>: Replaces the wearer's Control Break Skill with the more powerful <Yellow>Proof of Glory</>: \nRemoves all control effects from yourself and enter a 4-second <Yellow>Cage of Light</> state, during which you gain <Yellow>Super Armor</> and <Yellow>50%</> Damage Reduction. Any portion of damage received that does not exceed 10% of your maximum Health is reflected back to the attacker at <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}</> times the value (for targets beyond 8 meters, the reflected damage is further reduced, down to a minimum of 20% of the damage within 8 meters). <Yellow>When the Cage of Light</> ends, deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?*d}</> damage to up to 6 hostile targets within 8 meters, and apply a <Yellow>10</>-second <Yellow>Dazzle</> effect, reducing their Attack by <Yellow>*d</>. \nSkill Cooldown: 30 seconds.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>奖励次数累积规则：</>\n队伍副本通关每个阶段后可以领取<Highlight>1</>次奖励，共计<Highlight>3</>个阶段，每个阶段奖励次数每周增加<Highlight>1</>次，最多可累积到<Highlight>2</>次。\n不同难度，不同类型的副本每周增加的奖励次数<Highlight>共上限</>，即每周可领取<Highlight>3</>次奖励。但解锁新副本时，之前剩余的奖励次数不会累积到新副本上。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>初始奖励次数：</>\n新副本解锁时会额外获得<Highlight>1</>次初始奖励次数，<Highlight>初始奖励次数优先消耗，且不计入累计次数上限，也不受共上限影响</>。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>当前副本剩余奖励次数：</>\n<Highlight>%s</>：个人奖励<Highlight>%s</>次 公共奖励<Highlight>%s</>次\n<Highlight>%s</>：个人奖励<Highlight>%s</>次 公共奖励<Highlight>%s</>次\n<Highlight>%s</>：个人奖励<Highlight>%s</>次 公共奖励<Highlight>%s</>次\n参与人机模式仅消耗个人奖励次数，参与组队模式同时消耗个人奖励次数和公共奖励次数。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Reward Count Accumulation Rules: </>\nAfter clearing each stage of a party dungeon, you can claim <Highlight>1</> reward, for a total of <Highlight>3</> stages. Reward counts for each stage increase by <Highlight>1</> weekly, up to a maximum of <Highlight>2</>. \nThe weekly reward count increase for different difficulties and types of dungeons <Highlight>shares a cap</>, meaning you can claim <Highlight>3</> rewards per week. However, when a new dungeon is unlocked, remaining reward counts from previous dungeons will not carry over. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Initial reward counts: </>\nWhen a new dungeon is unlocked, you will receive an additional <Highlight>1</> initial reward count. <Highlight>Initial reward counts are consumed first and do not count towards the cumulative limit, nor are they affected by the shared cap.</> \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Remaining rewards for current dungeon: </>\n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \nParticipating in AI mode only consumes personal reward counts, while participating in party mode consumes both personal and public reward counts.",
