    ["　　又落榜了……已经数不清是第几次落榜了……\n\n　　或许我生来就不适合成为一名政府雇员，仔细经营好那个小肉摊、和一个美丽的妻子一起过日子才是我应该过的生活。\n\n　　她会为我洗衣服，我会为她炖肉，让她成为全廷根吃过最多肉的女人。\n\n　　真是美好的生活……我该振作起来，努力去找一个妻子了。"] = "　　Failed the exam again... I've lost count of how many times I've failed... \n \n　　Perhaps I wasn't born to be a government employee. Carefully managing that little meat stall and living a life with a beautiful wife is the life I should be living. \n \n　　She will wash my clothes, and I will stew meat for her, making her the woman who has eaten the most meat in all of Tingen. \n \n　　What a wonderful life... I should pull myself together and work hard to find a wife.",
